[claude:event result] {"duration_api_ms":157789,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"af2b2e15-bb4a-424a-b537-47c609def65e","total_cost_usd":0.11571725,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18359,"cache_read_input_tokens":26785,"output_tokens":17765,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16839},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":18359},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":423,"cache_read_input_tokens":13864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":17416,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001248,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":17765,"cacheReadInputTokens":26785,"cacheCreationInputTokens":18359,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.11446925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":16839,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":2,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The regex pattern has been saved. Here's how it works:\n\n**IPv4 Validation** (octet pattern: `25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9]?[0-9]`):\n- `25[0-5]`: 250-255\n- `2[0-4][0-9]`: 200-249\n- `1[0-9]{2}`: 100-199\n- `[1-9]?[0-9]`: 0-99 (no leading zeros)\n\n**Date Validation** (per month):\n- **31-day months** (01,03,05,07,08,10,12): days 01-31\n- **30-day months** (04,06,09,11): days 01-30\n- **February** (02): days 01-29\n\n**Pattern Logic**:\n1. `(?=.*IPv4)` - Positive lookahead ensures an IPv4 address exists on the line\n2. `.*?` - Non-greedy match to find the first candidate date\n3. `(date)` - Capture the date (only content within parentheses is returned by `re.findall`)\n4. `(?!.*date)` - Negative lookahead ensures no other date follows on the same line\n\nWord boundaries (`\\b`) prevent matches like \"1134-12-1234\" (where no valid IPv4 exists) or \"error-2024-01-15\" when preceded by alphanumerics.","ttft_ms":149335,"type":"result","duration_ms":156574,"uuid":"0b73486b-7517-466f-aa85-3a0e86b8a737","ttft_stream_ms":879,"time_to_request_ms":43,"queued_turn_count":0}
